  {
    "sha": "cff386618c93725c087c339decf8a6536cf719ca",
    "node_id": "C_kwDOOmBWg9oAKGNmZjM4NjYxOGM5MzcyNWMwODdjMzM5ZGVjZjhhNjUzNmNmNzE5Y2E",
    "commit": {
      "author": {
        "name": "Maxim",
        "email": "maxim.zubarev@icloud.com",
        "date": "2026-10-05T16:40:50Z"
      },
      "committer": {
        "name": "Maxim",
        "email": "maxim.zubarev@icloud.com",
        "date": "2026-10-05T16:40:50Z"
      },
      "message": "test(dojo): drop the stale tool-call parents from the deepagents trace\n\nOn the HITL resume run, OnToolEnd replays TOOL_CALL_START for\nrequest_human_approval and the outer `task` call. The baseline pinned their\nparentMessageId as the call's own id, which the TOOL_CALL_RESULT also used\nas its messageId: the collision this PR fixes. The owners were made in the\nprevious run, so the replayed starts now name no parent.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "2a4db532d9cef35d48cd7b7d7bdb3fb36601bf16",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/git/trees/2a4db532d9cef35d48cd7b7d7bdb3fb36601bf16"
      },
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ag-ui-protocol/ag-ui/git/commits/cff386618c93725c087c339decf8a6536cf719ca",
      "comment_count": 0,
      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAglfSWH8dTMTpk9pXsmBYgC/P+AB\nNrUmLUky5k9tnhvkMAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQPJ9Qvt8SepYFda5tQJypWhL5FAoQss6tbyc4mAsSMnOE6Pv0F7ON4x95Wb0Npfm3P\nYfK2h9M56REE+xmkJtAA0=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----",
        "payload": "tree 2a4db532d9cef35d48cd7b7d7bdb3fb36601bf16\nparent d52cc7f6f37c027faec4f6b6bffa303395346374\nauthor Maxim <maxim.zubarev@icloud.com> 1791218450 +0200\ncommitter Maxim <maxim.zubarev@icloud.com> 1791218450 +0200\n\ntest(dojo): drop the stale tool-call parents from the deepagents trace\n\nOn the HITL resume run, OnToolEnd replays TOOL_CALL_START for\nrequest_human_approval and the outer `task` call. The baseline pinned their\nparentMessageId as the call's own id, which the TOOL_CALL_RESULT also used\nas its messageId: the collision this PR fixes. The owners were made in the\nprevious run, so the replayed starts now name no parent.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n",
        "verified_at": "2026-10-05T16:40:54Z"
      }
    },
